WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.599 --> 00:00:04.680
The voicemail number that you can call 24
hours a day is 2 1 9 2.

00:00:04.680 --> 00:00:05.810
David P..

00:00:05.810 --> 00:00:07.319
Here is a protest.

00:00:07.319 --> 00:00:08.319
Sorry.

00:00:08.319 --> 00:00:13.511
Here's a caller who doesn't care if the protesters
die of Corona virus, but unfortunately, it's

00:00:13.511 --> 00:00:15.630
more complicated than that.

00:00:15.630 --> 00:00:24.710
Listen, David, I know this is sort of unpopular
to say, especially with like knowing your

00:00:24.710 --> 00:00:28.869
views, but honestly, dude.

00:00:28.869 --> 00:00:38.890
I don't care if some of these protesters die
as a result of their irresponsible actions.

00:00:38.890 --> 00:00:39.890
I get it.

00:00:39.890 --> 00:00:43.239
The problem is other people will also die.

00:00:43.239 --> 00:00:50.530
I'm mostly on board with if this is truly
a sort of natural selection type thing where

00:00:50.530 --> 00:00:55.460
if the protesters want to protest and they
are the only ones sick of at risk of getting

00:00:55.460 --> 00:00:58.890
sick and dying at a certain point it's like,
OK, let them do it now.

00:00:58.890 --> 00:01:01.889
The problem is some of them are bringing their
kids.

00:01:01.889 --> 00:01:04.589
Are their kids really able to consent to that?

00:01:04.589 --> 00:01:06.190
Do the kids really understand the risks?

00:01:06.190 --> 00:01:07.190
I don't think so.

00:01:07.190 --> 00:01:11.180
But if you imagine, only the protesters are
the ones that risk dying by protesting.

00:01:11.180 --> 00:01:13.570
At a certain point, I would say, fine, just
let him do it.

00:01:13.570 --> 00:01:16.060
The problem is they become spreaders of the
disease.

00:01:16.060 --> 00:01:20.140
And so while you are right, you were also
missing that.

00:01:20.140 --> 00:01:23.800
It's a fantasy to imagine that the protesters
are only putting themselves at risk.

00:01:23.800 --> 00:01:24.969
That's the problem.

